# Chl a (phytyl truncated to methyl ester), ground-state DFT
# Goal: extract the 4 Gouterman frontier MO energies (HOMO-1, HOMO, LUMO,
# LUMO+1) to test whether their splitting predicts the ~2240 cm^-1
# Bx-By gap the redundancy relation derived from real Qx/Qy data (Phase 3).
#
# RIJCOSX + def2/J: standard RI approximation for hybrid-functional HF
# exchange in ORCA - large speed gain, negligible accuracy cost.
# D3BJ: dispersion correction, standard practice for conjugated organics.
! B3LYP def2-SVP RIJCOSX def2/J D3BJ Opt

%pal
  nprocs 16
end

%maxcore 3000

